    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relic Digger</strong> is an underground exploration game where every shovelful of dirt might hide a fortune \u2014 or an ancient mystery! Step into the shoes of a digger on a quest for relics, rare minerals, and long-lost secrets buried deep beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, collect, and sell the resources you find to invest in new tools, more powerful equipment, and special items that will supercharge your adventure. The more you upgrade, the deeper you can go \u2014 and the greater the rewards (and the dangers).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With charming visuals and addictive gameplay, <strong>Relic Digger</strong> is perfect for players who love exploration, progression, and the thrill of uncovering something valuable right under their nose.</p>",
